{"created": "2026-06-09T05:25:01.248168+00:00", "modified": "2026-06-09T05:25:02.565254+00:00", "id": 20582405, "conceptrecid": "20582404", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20582405", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.20582404", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20582405", "metadata": {"title": "PID-GraphVAE: 2D CFD datasets, trained models, and identification records for 'From compression to discovery'", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20582405", "publication_date": "2026-06-07", "description": "<div>This dataset contains four ZIP archives supporting the study on flow field representation and equation discovery.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>flow2d_coordinate.zip provides the mesh coordinates (exported from the first Fluent CSV file) shared across all 2-D flow cases. flow2d_dataset.zip holds the three 2-D transient CFD datasets (backward-facing step, cylinder pair, and pitching NACA0018) in HDF5 format, ready for training and testing. flow2d_model.zip includes model weight files for every test case: both fixed\u2011topology and data\u2011driven topology variants under three random initialisation seeds per case. flow2d_sindy_results.zip contains the sparse identification of nonlinear dynamics (SINDy) outputs for both topology approaches, including the discovered governing equations and coefficient tables.</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Liu, Ao", "affiliation": "Shanghai University", "orcid": "0009-0008-9138-0059"}, {"name": "Wu, Pin", "affiliation": "Shanghai University", "orcid": "0000-0002-1411-1188"}, {"name": "Yao, Yuan", "affiliation": "Shanghai University", "orcid": "0000-0003-3302-4909"}, {"name": "Zhang, Yifan", "affiliation": "Shanghai University"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "20582404"}}]}}, "title": "PID-GraphVAE: 2D CFD datasets, trained models, and identification records for 'From